hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2706","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bishar; he narrated to us Abu Bakr (meaning the Hanafi); he narrated to us al-Dahhak ibn Uthman; he narrated to me Sa'id al-Maqburi; on the authority of Abu Hurairah (RA); that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \When any one of you enters the mosque"," let him send greetings upon the Prophet (ﷺ) and supplicate: 'O Allah"," open for me the doors of Your mercy.' And when he exits"," let him send greetings upon the Prophet (ﷺ) and supplicate: 'O Allah"," grant me refuge from the accursed Satan.'\"""""
